# definition. No production caller left — `_default_pool` used to be it, and now
# asks `_account_ok` about every rostered account that is not home-able,
# whichever session is asking (2026-09-07) — so this survives as the NAME of
# the equivalence, which ccd-account-ok.test.ts pins: the gpt kill-switch is
