  # cooldown, ccgpt-usage's JSON shape), which is a fact about THAT backend and
  # not about "an account that is not home-able". That distinction is why this
  # is driven by CCRC_CODEX_BACKEND (`telemetry === 'codex'`) and never by the
  # complement of CCRC_HOME_ABLE or of CCRC_ANTHROPIC_BACKEND: a future lane on
